2026-09-21 — AU05 battery decoding, static analysis only
Sources: /Applications/Ulanzi Studio.app/Contents/Frameworks/kwdm.dylib
         /Applications/Ulanzi Studio.app/Contents/MacOS/UlanziDeck
lldb target create + disassemble only; Studio was not launched.

[CONFIRMED] frame[4..5] little-endian voltage; frame[6..7] little-endian battery level.
[CONFIRMED] frame[10] is passed as charging; frame[8..9] are not interpreted here.
[CONFIRMED] battery is forwarded to the battery icon with a 100 upper bound and 10/25/50/75 thresholds.
This confirms the 0–100 battery level used as percentage, not a voltage-derived estimate.
Unknown charging values remain unknown in Olanzi.

